+# Agentic Workflow v3 MVP
+
+Agentic Workflow v3 is a reliability layer around the existing Claude Code workflow.
+
+It does not replace `/plan`, `/review`, `/ship`, worktrees, hooks, or subagents. It adds durable run records, failure cases, ship evidence, and metrics.
+
+## Workflow A: Start a Run
+
+Use for substantial coding tasks.
+
+```powershell
+powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File C:\Users\PC\agentic-workflow\scripts\new_run.ps1 `
+  -Objective "Fix failing navbar test" `
+  -Repo C:\Users\PC\example-repo `
+  -RiskLevel medium `
+  -ValidationPlan "npm test","npm run lint"
+```
+
+Done when `runs/<run-id>/run.json` exists before major edits.
+
+## Workflow B: Ship a Change
+
+Run the normal `/ship` process first: diff scan, independent review, validation, and evidence.
+
+Then complete the run record:
+
+```powershell
+powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File C:\Users\PC\agentic-workflow\scripts\complete_run.ps1 `
+  -RunId 2026-07-08_1530_fix-navbar-test `
+  -Status shipped `
+  -FinalOutcome "Fixed failing navbar test and added regression coverage." `
+  -ReviewerResult "No must-fix findings remain." `
+  -Evidence "npm test and npm run lint passed." `
+  -CaptureDiff
+```
+
+Done when `evidence.md`, `review.md`, `final.md`, and `diff.patch` tell the story without opening chat history.
+
+## Workflow C: Capture Failure
+
+Use when tests fail, review finds a serious issue, the user reports a regression, or the agent behavior itself was wrong.
+
+```powershell
+powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File C:\Users\PC\agentic-workflow\scripts\capture_failure.ps1 `
+  -Summary "Reviewer caught wrong order confirmation flow" `
+  -LinkedRun 2026-07-08_1530_fix-navbar-test `
+  -FailureClass weak_verification `
+  -Severity must_fix `
+  -ReproCommand "pytest tests/test_orders.py -k confirmation"
+```
+
+Done when the case has expected behavior, actual behavior, reproduction, classification, fix, regression, and prevention layer.
+
+## Workflow D: Summarize Metrics
+
+```powershell
+powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File C:\Users\PC\agentic-workflow\scripts\summarize_metrics.ps1
+```
+
+Done when `metrics/summary.md` shows runs, shipped runs, failure classes, regressions, and evidence rate.
